97,"name":"Laurent Alexandre","role":"Henri Margeaux","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/sL9xgibwkLoosELkVbiJIfhpAzu.jpg"},{"id":1556888,"name":"Jill Parker-Jones","role":"Nasty Stewardess"},{"id":2751663,"name":"Timmy Fitzpatrick","role":"Kid in Bathroom"},{"id":4959711,"name":"Sandy McCormack","role":"Huge Man on Plane"},{"id":4959714,"name":"Francesco Fantasia","role":"Bernardo Salviati"},{"id":3563545,"name":"Alex Ardenti","role":"Bouncer"},{"id":4959716,"name":"Robert Branco","role":"Prison Guard"},{"id":1219534,"name":"Joseph Vassallo","role":"Customs Official","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/oR2mvSB4xeqZASoeyXK8xrLTyHw.jpg"},{"id":4362013,"name":"Robert Tagliapietra","role":"Gondolier"},{"id":43115,"name":"Clement von Franckenstein","role":"Car Rental Clerk"},{"id":1497310,"name":"Anderson Goncalves","role":"Bellboy","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/u5JYg7mZEB74eXckIXToB6sa7h0.jpg"},{"id":104246,"name":"Guido Föhrweißer","role":"Tow Truck Driver","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/x35Mm2D68HWmQFKhJgpnuVLfhrm.jpg"},{"id":1217001,"name":"Lorenzo Caccialanza","role":"Italian Man","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4lUFz3Sgp0DOPlt0PbiyuAqENV.jpg"},{"id":5047,"name":"Veronica Cartwright","role":"Mrs. 'Pussy' McNerney (uncredited)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1CiknHO8ssMM4bWPsIMMzCTVHeB.jpg"},{"id":261491,"name":"Cheryl Dent","role":"Girl in Park (uncredited)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/eGLHlgq9ngmLyOmCBw2zB0VNb6b.jpg"},{"id":1657018,"name":"Summer Moore","role":"Bar Patron (uncredited)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fLblBz4YsOOOKkSdliFkG3Z0zxy.jpg"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","title":"Oggi sposi... niente sesso!","overview":"Tom lavora alla radio dove si occupa di bollettini stradali notturni: è un bel ragazzo, ha una vita normale e un'insana passione per lo sport. Sarah invece è un'esperta d'arte dallo spirito libero con una famiglia tanto benestante quanto snob. I due, vittime del classico colpo di fulmine, decidono di sposarsi in tutta fretta e dopo il matrimonio partono per il viaggio di nozze in Italia, convinti di vivere un'esperienza che sarà l'idilliaco coronamento del loro sogno d'amore. Grazie al ricco ex fidanzato di Sarah , però, e ad un'irriducibile sfortuna, gli sposini sperimenteranno una luna di miele d'inferno che metterà a dura prova il loro acerbo rapporto.","tagline":"Era una relazione perfetta...finché non si sposarono"},{"language":"en-US","overview":"Although Tom Leezak and Sarah McNerney come from different worlds, they are both unexpectedly swept off their feet after their first meeting. They quickly fall in love and plan to get married, despite opposition from Sarah's uptight, rich family. After their wedding, the happy couple sets off - with the highest of hopes and ideals about love and marriage - on what they expect will be the perfect honeymoon in Italy. Thanks to a relentless string of bad luck with one disaster after another, and an impromptu visit from Sarah's wealthy one-time ex-lover Peter Prentiss, the newlyweds experience the honeymoon from hell that tests the limits of their young love.  Is it worth throwing away their love and marriage?","tagline":"It was the perfect honeymoon...until it began."}],"images":{"logos":[{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lSTEVbLtw5HnD9ObYfTtLvH3gvM.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/lSTEVbLtw5HnD9ObYfTtLvH3gvM.png","language":"it","width":582,"height":225},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1kN6WKPxC7u6qr6c8vN7J9GSXJU.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/1kN6WKPxC7u6qr6c8vN7J9GSXJU.png","language":"en","width":2000,"height":434}],"posters":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/198QQG4YmQQLKL3gVchL8svgg36.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/198QQG4YmQQLKL3gV